| 0 | 0.9060 | 0.5000 | 0.5000 | -2.2e-16 |
| 1 | 1.4635 | 1.5000 | 1.5000 | -4.4e-15 |
| 2 | 0.6688 | 3.0000 | 3.0000 | 0.0e+00 |

Autograd against the closed forms: max difference 0.0e+00 for ∂L/∂g and 3.6e-15 for ∂L/∂v.

