| 10 | 1.814347 | 5.0e-03 |
| 20 | 1.822774 | 3.6e-04 |
| 30 | 1.823345 | 4.6e-05 |

One iteration per call, u stored between calls (same W): call 1: relative error 2.4e-01; call 2: relative error 1.4e-01; call 5: relative error 3.7e-02; call 10: relative error 5.5e-03; call 20: relative error 4.8e-04;
